      "status":"PROPOSED"
    },
    {
      "dimension":"definitions",
      "explanation":"Covered funds are UCITS domiciled in France, Luxembourg, Ireland or the Netherlands, and UK-domiciled schemes authorised as UK UCITS. Materiality, novelty, complexity and possible local policy implications lack supplied assessment criteria.",
      "source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u17.2556","d97b56331f41a.u5.840"],
      "status":"AMBIGUOUS"
    },
    {
      "dimension":"exceptions",
      "explanation":"The product-feature and policy exceptions attach to item (ii)'s removal, with novelty, complexity and possible policy implications independently sufficient. The substantive dispute concerns whether application transition additionally defeats relief or preserves only processing. Extending item (ii)'s exceptions across separately numbered items (i) and (iii) lacks sufficient textual support.",
      "source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u4.653","d97b56331f41a.u5.840","d97b56331f41a.u6.1221","d97b56331f41a.u10.1809"],
      "status":"AMBIGUOUS"
    },
    {
      "dimension":"modality",
      "explanation":"Removal is conditional relief from a specified SFC requirement, not unrestricted permission to implement a change. The SFC states that post-vetting will continue and that it may make enquiries or take regulatory action for non-compliance. Failure of relief does not supply a complete affirmative approval-duty rule.",
      "source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u5.840","d97b56331f41a.u10.1809","d97b56331f41a.u12.2069"],
      "status":"PROPOSED"
    },
    {
      "dimension":"time",
      "explanation":"Use the express 28 November 2025 commencement date. Receipt strictly before that date and absence of approval or authorisation identify preserved applications, provisionally assessed at transition. Publication date and the legally relevant assessment event are not supplied.",
      "source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u1.190","d97b56331f41a.u9.1696","d97b56331f41a.u10.1809"],
      "status":"AMBIGUOUS"
    },
    {
      "dimension":"dependencies",
      "explanation":"FAQs, forms, checklists, applicable home-jurisdiction requirements and the existing approval process are needed for full application. The two opaque missing-dependency identifiers cannot reliably be mapped by their order, despite one diagnostic doing so.",
